<%- include('../partials/head', { scripts: ['/static/js/booking.js'] }) %>
<div class="page-head"><h1><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-plus h-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>Book a consultation</h1></div>
<div class="split">
  <div class="card">
    <%- include('../partials/errors') %>
    <%- include('../partials/booking_form', { action: '/patient/book' }) %>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-question h-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>Is a remote consultation right for me?</h2>
      <p><strong>Usually suitable:</strong> follow-up visits, review of test results, mild illnesses (cold, mild fever, minor skin
        problems), prescription renewals for long-term conditions, mental-health and general health advice.</p>
      <p><strong>Come in person if</strong> you need a physical examination, injection, dressing, laboratory test, or if your
        symptoms are severe.</p>
      <p class="muted">The doctor may ask you to come to the clinic if they cannot safely assess you remotely.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="alert alert-warn"><strong>Emergency?</strong> Do not book — go straight to the UHS emergency unit.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
